# "Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to that permanent" names the creature Guardian Angel targeted, which
# nothing targets as {1} is paid (CR 116.2c): once Mother of Runes has given herself protection from white, and so is no
# legal target for a white spell, paying {1} twice still shields her (protection stops no prevention effect, CR 702.16).
# Bot1's own Shock (red) then deals her nothing, and the 1/1 lives.
